  "<div class=\"recuerda\">\n    <div class=\"recuerda-titulo\">💡 Recuerda</div>\n    <div class=\"recuerda-idea\">El reloj tiene <strong>2 agujas</strong>: la <strong>corta</strong> marca la <strong>HORA</strong> y la <strong>larga</strong> marca los <strong>MINUTOS</strong>.</div>\n    <div class=\"recuerda-idea\">Cuando la aguja <strong>larga</strong> apunta al <strong>12</strong>, decimos que es la hora <strong>en punto</strong>.</div>\n    <div class=\"recuerda-idea\">En el reloj <strong>digital</strong> se escribe así: las <strong>3 en punto</strong> = <strong>3:00</strong>. Las <strong>8 en punto</strong> = <strong>8:00</strong>.</div>\n  </div>",
  "<div class=\"ej-block\">\n    <div class=\"ej-enunciado\"><span class=\"num\">1.</span> Une cada <strong>reloj</strong> con su <strong>hora digital</strong>:</div>\n\n    <div class=\"unir-fila\">\n      <div class=\"unir-izq\">\n        <svg class=\"reloj\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\">\n          <circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"46\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/>\n          <g font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000\">\n            <text x=\"50\" y=\"17\">12</text><text x=\"68\" y=\"22\">1</text><text x=\"82\" y=\"36\">2</text><text x=\"87\" y=\"54\">3</text><text x=\"82\" y=\"72\">4</text><text x=\"68\" y=\"86\">5</text>\n            <text x=\"50\" y=\"91\">6</text><text x=\"32\" y=\"86\">7</text><text x=\"18\" y=\"72\">8</text><text x=\"13\" y=\"54\">9</text><text x=\"18\" y=\"36\">10</text><text x=\"32\" y=\"22\">11</text>\n          </g>\n          <circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"#000\"/>\n          <line x1=\"50\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"50\" y2=\"20\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n          <line x1=\"50\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"68\" y2=\"50\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"unir-libre\"></div>\n      <div class=\"unir-der\"><span class=\"digital\">9:00</span></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"unir-fila\">\n      <div class=\"unir-izq\">\n        <svg class=\"reloj\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\">\n          <circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"46\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/>\n          <g font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000\">\n            <text x=\"50\" y=\"17\">12</text><text x=\"68\" y=\"22\">1</text><text x=\"82\" y=\"36\">2</text><text x=\"87\" y=\"54\">3</text><text x=\"82\" y=\"72\">4</text><text x=\"68\" y=\"86\">5</text>\n            <text x=\"50\" y=\"91\">6</text><text x=\"32\" y